  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/header_paperdoll.png\" alt=\"紙娃娃橫幅\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/caVV5eXekm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Discord-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Github-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpaperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Modrinth-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Curseforge-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftr7zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Kofi-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/About.png\" alt=\"關於\"><br></p><p>PaperDoll 是一款客戶端模組，可在介面上新增基岩風格的紙娃娃。它高度可自訂，能透過提供更沉浸的角色視角來強化你的遊戲體驗。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/Features.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p><h3>功能豐富</h3><ul>\n<li>支援觀察其他實體</li>\n<li>船隻等載具及其乘客完整顯示</li>\n<li>高度相容於 Essential、Wavey Capes、3D Skin Layers 等模組</li>\n</ul><h3>高度可自訂</h3><ul>\n<li>自由放置和縮放紙娃娃</li>\n<li>可完全設定顯示邏輯，僅在特定動作時顯示紙娃娃</li>\n<li>多種不同的觀察行為</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252ftr7zw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/essential_1.png\" alt=\"Essential\"></a><br><br></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Compatibility &amp; Dependancys.png\" alt=\"相容性與依賴\"></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>載入器</th>\n<th>狀態</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>備註</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.16.5+</td>\n<td>Fabric/Forge<em>/NeoForge</em></td>\n<td>✅ 支援</td>\n<td>最新</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.21.6/7</td>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>❌ 不支援</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>NeoForge 因某些原因必須對原版邏輯做出重大不相容變更，目前導致該模組在此處失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.16.5</td>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>⚠️ 不支援</td>\n<td>過時</td>\n<td>不支援，直到獲得 JarInJar 模組的支援為止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Screenshots Media.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖 / 媒體\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/raw/1.18/screenshots/boats.png\" alt=\"紙娃娃範例\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Known Issues.png\" alt=\"已知問題\"></p><ul>\n<li>某些坐騎無法正確顯示</li>\n<li>不支援發光效果</li>\n<li>詳細動畫似乎有方向問題</li>\n<li>騎馬跳躍時的偏移不正確</li>\n</ul><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/FAQ.png\" alt=\"常見問題\"></p><h3>伺服器端需要安裝此模組嗎？</h3><p>不需要。這是純客戶端模組，伺服器端<strong>無需</strong>安裝。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Credits &amp; License.png\" alt=\"致謝與授權\"></p><p>👤 感謝 GitHub 上出色的翻譯者與貢獻者！\n<a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/links/underlined/more_details.png\" alt=\"連結\">\n</a> <br><br>\n📄 授權條款：tr7zw Protective License <br>\n歡迎在 Modrinth/Curseforge 託管的模組包中使用本模組，無需徵求許可。請勿在其他地方重新散布 jar 檔案！</p>",
